- Added Haranir heritage armor and its variant to *Cosmetics* list
- Added missing title rewards from Patch 12.1.0
- Added rewards for new achievements introduced in patch 12.1.5 (hidden until patch release date)
- *Bug Fix:* Attempt to resolve issue with mount reward previews occasionally failing to display when they hadn't finished loading in time
- *Bug Fix:* Removed a debugging print message that was mistakenly left in the code in earlier releases

